s'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'&raquo;\\4feed link'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'%1$s %2$s iCal Feed'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['wpml-string-translation',1]],'One more thing left to do...'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'To complete this major calendar upgrade, you need to migrate your events to the new data storage system. Once migration finishes, you can take advantage of all the cool new 6.0 features!'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Hello,'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'This information serves as a guide on what sections need to be modified due to usage of The Events Calendar and its Add-ons.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'You should include the information below in the correct sections of you privacy policy.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Disclaimer:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'This information is only for guidance and not to be considered as legal advice.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'What personal data we collect and why we collect it'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Event, Venue, and Organizer Information'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Through the usage of The Events Calendar, Events Calendar PRO, The Events Calendar Filter Bar, Eventbrite Tickets, and Community Events plugins, as well as our Event Aggregator Import service (contained within The Events Calendar plugin), information may be collected and stored within your website’s database.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Suggested text:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'If you create, submit, import, save, or publish Event, Venue, or Organizer information, such information is retained in the local database:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Venue information: name, address, city, country, state, postal code, phone, website, geographical coordinates (latitude and longitude)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Organizer information: name, phone, website, email'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Event information: website, cost, description, date, time, image'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Importing Events, Venues, and Organizers:'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'All data present within a CSV or ICS file and external URLs (for events, venues, organizers, and tickets)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Import origin data (URL from where events are being imported—such as Eventbrite, MeetUp, other compatible URL sources, and more, which can include similar or same data as listed above)'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Eventbrite Ticket information: name, description, cost, type, quantity'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Please note that to create new events through the Community Events submission form, a user must hold a website account on this domain. This information is retained in the local database. It is also possible to create events anonymously, if the site owner has this option enabled.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'When purchasing Eventbrite Tickets, attendee, purchaser, and order information are stored and managed by Eventbrite.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'API Keys'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The Events Calendar suite offers the use of third-party API keys. The primary functions are to enhance the features we\'ve built in, some of which use Google Maps, PayPal, Eventbrite, and Meetup. These API keys are not supplied by The Events Calendar.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'We make use of certain APIs, in order to provide specific features.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'These APIs may include the following third party services: Google Maps (API key), Meetup (OAuth token), PayPal (email, Client ID, Client Secret), Eventbrite (API key, auth URL, Client Secret), and Zoom (email, Client ID, Client Secret).'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'How Long You Retain this Data'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'All information (data) is retained in the local database indefinitely, unless otherwise deleted.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Certain data may be exported or removed upon users’ requests via the existing Exporter or Eraser. Please note, however, that several “edge cases” exist in which we are unable to perfect the gathering and export of all data for your end users. We suggest running a search in your local database, as well as within the WordPress Dashboard, in order to identify all data collected and stored for your specific user requests.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Where We Send Your Data'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The Events Calendar does not send any user data outside of your website by default.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'If you have extended our plugin(s) to send data to a third-party service such as Eventbrite, Google Maps, or PayPal, user information may be passed to these external services. These services may be located abroad.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Category'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The import unique ID as provided by Event Aggregator service'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The hash of the next expected batch, as previously provided by the client'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The current status of the import.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The percentage of import completed.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The current interval, in seconds, between the end of a batch process and the start of the next; as set on the server.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The new status of the import.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The new status message for the user, not localized.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The new status message slug, to allow for localized messages.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The archive page to return'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'The number of events to return on each page'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that start on the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that end on the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that start before the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that start after the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that end before the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events that end after the specified date'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Dates set using the start_date/end_date, starts_*/ends_* are set to start at the specified times. The default behavior is to include the entire days.'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events should contain the specified string in the title or description'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events should be assigned one of the specified categories slugs or IDs'=>['urls'=>[],'names'=>[],'cmp'=>['the-events-calendar',1]],'Events sho